{
  "info": {
    "name": "HF Medusa — Suggestive Selling + Voucher (Admin + Store)",
    "description": "Admin + Store API collection cho HF Medusa. Gồm 3 nhóm:\n- **Suggestion Rules (Admin)** (SRS §6.1) — track suggestive-selling.\n- **Voucher Engine (Admin) — Hùng** (Day 4, tasks 3.4.11–3.4.13) — tạo voucher + xem analytics.\n- **Store (Suggestions) — Sơn** (API Contract §1.1) — endpoint gợi ý phía store (public).\n\nUsage:\n1. Chạy 'Auth › Login' trước — tự lưu {{token}} (Admin requests).\n2. Suggestion: 'Create' lưu {{ruleId}} cho List/Get/Update/Delete.\n3. Voucher: 'Create voucher — percentage' lưu {{voucherId}}/{{voucherCode}} cho 'Get analytics'.\n4. Store requests là public [C]: không cần {{token}} nhưng cần header {{publishableKey}}; set {{cartId}} trước khi gọi cart suggestions.\n\nEdit collection variables (baseUrl, adminEmail, adminPassword, sourceProductId, suggestedProductId, categoryId, publishableKey, cartId, sessionId) cho khớp môi trường.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:9009" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "postman@test.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Supersecret123" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "ruleId", "value": "" },
    {
      "key": "voucherId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Auto-set bởi 'Voucher › Create voucher — percentage'."
    },
    {
      "key": "voucherCode",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Auto-set (mã UPPERCASE) bởi 'Voucher › Create voucher — percentage'."
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Optional — id category cho ví dụ voucher scoped (V6). Lấy từ `pnpm backend:seed` hoặc để trống → voucher unscoped."
    },
    {
      "key": "sourceProductId",
      "value": "prod_01KXFDDXE555Y50DG7XBPCM7FX",
      "description": "yonex-astrox-99-pro — has 3 Tier-1 manual suggestions → NO backfill (T-SUGG-01). NOTE: product ids are seed-generated and change on every reseed; refresh after `db:migrate`."
    },
    {
      "key": "suggestedProductId",
      "value": "prod_01KXFDDXE5BC0YN9D58XT754HH",
      "description": "yonex-bg65 (from seed) — refresh on reseed."
